# Line endings.
#
# This repository ships PowerShell tooling that is meant to be byte-exact:
# BOM-less UTF-8 with LF endings (Windows PowerShell 5.1 parses a BOM-less UTF-8 file as
# ANSI, and the scheduled-task scripts must stay pure ASCII).
#
# With core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout, git would hand back CRLF and the files
# would no longer match what the scripts document, so pin the endings here.

* text=auto
*.ps1  text eol=lf
*.cs   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
